<title>USA: Jefferson UHSD, Calif., won by O'Connor &amp; Co..</title>
<headline>Jefferson UHSD, Calif., won by O'Connor &amp; Co..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>O'Connor &amp; Co. said it won $6 million of Jefferson Union HSD, Calif., general obligation bonds, Election 1995, Series B, with a true interest cost of 5.54 percent.</p>
</text>
